<tr><td align=3D"left" class=3D"text" style=3D"background:#FFFFFF;font-size=
:0px;padding:0 16px;word-break:break-word;"><div style=3D"font-family:Georg=
ia, serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;line-height:22px;text-align:left;c=
olor:#121212;">
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">As ringing endorsements from the punditocr=
acy go, not being quite as terrible as they were against Spurs was just abo=
ut the best Manchester United could hope for after Atl=C3=A9tico saw out <a=
 href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_=
XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHEBgtjhYSJYcaNsDra0BxnPguTOUSrqjckgxiP6OrAZS9jsBqY=
McGUdqlItV_sLdGwJ4hFsJc86fQIp7y70h4CWD3xZTka_FC_DkqNNIxn_q7em98dCOm2C_1XUka=
2YuPMPotQidm68lyiVsVrTQPbsoDilAcbdHEjdseMnicAUFYkgAxMGb5SBkK18YEuxTcMf63YtK=
Rh2ditdJ7IvGNwnfldcXzBQlMcO9zjm1ZdbecN36GVPrHxGsd32_nYLKODXifo7SWAVeO01A7se=
3Lhs3/4uv/sJzU_eN-RGyy9p0q3mhBfg/h28/h001.rqVsZsIiRPG_0Ozn4s4Dl_2PAES9WMMdb=
_CPrAVCBlU" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">a fairly routine 2-0 Bigger Cup win</=
a> in Madrid on Tuesday night. In the opening minute, though, United <em>we=
re</em> every bit as terrible and more as they had been on Saturday, as the=
y allowed their hosts to steal an early march when Pablo Barrios=E2=80=99s =
shot beat Senne Lammens, only for the ball to squeeze under Leny Yoro, wipe=
 its feet and trundle over the line. For the benefit of our reader who can=
=E2=80=99t be bothered with Bigger Cup until the knockout stages, United we=
nt on to create chances they didn=E2=80=99t take, Atl=C3=A9tico had a goal =
ruled out by VAR for handball, both sides hit the woodwork and the game mor=
e or less ended as any kind of meaningful contest when Yoro was shown a rou=
gh red card. When your luck=E2=80=99s out, your luck=E2=80=99s out, and Ade=
mola Lookman made sure of things for Atl=C3=A9tico with a follow-up strike =
after Lammens saved from Jonathan David.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">While we=E2=80=99re prepared to concede we=
=E2=80=99ve probably made all that sound far more exciting than it actually=
 was, it was just a prelude to the real entertainment. That began after the=
 game when somebody from the United media team made the ill-advised and pot=
entially career-damaging decision to allow Lisandro Mart=C3=ADnez to run th=
e obligatory post-match interview gauntlet. For a man who hasn=E2=80=99t be=
en delivering much on-pitch bang for the generous buck he=E2=80=99s been pa=
id so far this season, Mart=C3=ADnez had plenty to get off his chest. Amazo=
n Prime=E2=80=99s pitchside reporter Gabriel Clarke thought all his birthda=
ys had come at once as the Argentinian started spitting home truths. =E2=80=
=9CTonight it is easy to say the coach, easy to say the players but also we=
 have to see other areas,=E2=80=9D <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theg=
uardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHEBgtjhYSJYca=
NsDra0BxnPgrDLLIHJquLHYWMNWzZ2G68SUhtHYmQ4a0tpyzMzEMcdPDzqxNFwl5jqv1GS59rCn=
ngSeZMASt36-0B_c6vVigaUGS1H3J9pd1WkKhESW0uLIOyFPx2hpiALPZA6qOZq55FO1jPvQpV_=
qOG4p9CgB-IvnR1CW4kSESrcGHYLwz_0sSf7IJPkkZrBDSBwC_BvqtRsCAhnRyIZIyZBjH87_ic=
e7j3gbww0dhvQehkiVGkA8rN75VKlb_5YqXWMkNN1JeLrAdHfuXuzZqgOD6R7mxQ/4uv/sJzU_e=
N-RGyy9p0q3mhBfg/h29/h001.CYyJmwKByhW41urpQG7e7QLLTPdIbTv7K9XV7mbK73w" styl=
e=3D"color: #0077B6;">he harrumphed</a>, pointing in a direction generally =
accepted to have been =E2=80=98upstairs=E2=80=99. =E2=80=9CI expect more [i=
nvestment], 100%. I expect more from our technical director [Jason Wilcox].=
 Last season we did everything, we created the base to create an amazing te=
am. You can=E2=80=99t keep changing, changing, changing the manager. What a=
bout other areas? I can=E2=80=99t say more.=E2=80=9D</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Except he could. Moments later, the centre=
-half cut loose again, embarking on a follow-up torching of Wilcox and Unit=
ed=E2=80=99s transfer policy in an interview with Peter Schmeichel for the =
CBS Bigger Cup B@nter Show. The former Manchester United goalkeeper, a glob=
al ambassador for the club, looked visibly flustered as Mart=C3=ADnez vente=
d but couldn=E2=80=99t shut him down despite repeated attempts to change th=
e subject. Opinions on Mart=C3=ADnez=E2=80=99s post-match tirades were mixe=
d, with some saying a man caught red-handed in close proximity to so many o=
n-pitch crime scenes this season has no right to belittle his teammates. Ot=
hers were of the view that any club dirty laundry should be washed behind c=
losed doors. Meanwhile, Big Website=E2=80=99s Jamie Jackson has it on good =
authority that Mart=C3=ADnez was simply airing an opinion <a href=3D"https:=
//ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fI=
EMgszcCSneHEBgtjhYSJYcaNsDra0BxnPg09uuqBaYiAtrR94-sWCbUXca_1HGR_z5vvn2NqK-v=
Lha59GuSAsLfTgetBTT8kkMWYk-LjQXgsSRdMrrcyAawaFvyoDPDHsy5dkPSp7ZJ6ddsYwtmv62=
Ckt6S6dGWhwvlcQ_wRwMK43bb88crcpMGWnaCv4XvlKZk1kBFUYX0_7M2NaXDoPIXt-66TpE7zg=
0Ew3FGE0qM5CTx3jiKl6ttPxVDGeE01vDeGkFugrsddpn-MkEDGgUc7HWrknAVaqF/4uv/sJzU_=
eN-RGyy9p0q3mhBfg/h30/h001.Yq-b-NHQXZVnIJktr8XeQ0ZlV55NJ6y6O88vOcl7jsQ" sty=
le=3D"color: #0077B6;">shared by most of his teammates</a>.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">As for their spokesman? One suspects Mart=
=C3=ADnez could pay a heavy price for running his mouth off in such a publi=
c fashion, with a hefty fine and an indefinite spell training with the kids=
 potentially just the start of any punishment that may be coming down the p=
ike. Having spent the early part of the season defending with all the poise=
 and assurance of a deckchair flapping in a gale-force wind, he is far from=
 indispensable and may well be angling for a January exit from an increasin=
gly listing United ship. If the club=E2=80=99s technical director is still =
around by then, the best revenge might well be to force the mouthy mutineer=
 to remain on board until his contract expires in June.</p>
